        "text": "Fast and cheap. The red line links the airport to the centre with one change."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Bus",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Carris buses cover the city. Buy a rechargeable Navegante card for about €0.50."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Tram",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Trams 15 and 28 are scenic but crowded; watch for pickpockets."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Taxi / ride apps",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Taxis use meters; insist on the meter and keep a receipt. Uber, Bolt and FreeNow work; look for the TVDE sign."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Rental car",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Driving in the centre is slow and parking is hard. Skip it for city days."
      },
